      "content": "Please do not take that propranolol without consulting a healthcare professional first. Medications like that can interact with your asthma or other conditions, and I am not qualified to give you medical advice. For immediate anxiety relief before your presentation, try deep breathing exercises or some light meditation. If the physical symptoms persist or worsen, please seek guidance from a doctor or pharmacist.",
